      {
        "id": 10997,
        "name": "kitmehsu",
        "username": "kitmehsu",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/kitmehsu/{size}/1901_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-16T19:16:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When proletariat uses overwhelm and uses it with duplicate, what happens?</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>All proletariat in play when overwhelm is used generate another</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>in addition to the effects of outcome 1, each spawned duplicate also generates another.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>And this leads me to another question, what happens if duplicate is used  with all duplicates already in play?  Shared burden explicitly specifies for itself that  it incaps, but I assume that’s an exception due to it explicitly mentioned. I assume it does nothing other than wasting an action outside of the overwhelm + duplicate combo.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:12.205Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 5.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 10994,
        "topic_slug": "overwhelming-duplicates",
        "display_username": "kitmehsu",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
        "flair_color": "",
        "flair_group_id": 41,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
