        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "When proletariat uses overwhelm and uses it with duplicate, what happens?\r\n\r\n1) All proletariat in play when overwhelm is used generate another\r\n\r\n2) in addition to the effects of outcome 1, each spawned duplicate also generates another. \r\n\r\nAnd this leads me to another question, what happens if duplicate is used  with all duplicates already in play?  Shared burden explicitly specifies for itself that  it incaps, but I assume that's an exception due to it explicitly mentioned. I assume it does nothing other than wasting an action outside of the overwhelm + duplicate combo.",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
