      {
        "id": 115081,
        "name": "McBehrer",
        "username": "McBehrer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-16T19:39:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The way I’ve always played it, it only triggers for those already on play. So, great for when you have 2-4 already in play. Not so much when you have 1 or 5, and useless when you have 6. As far as the second question goes, I would say it just doesn’t work with 6 already in play, since there’s nothing saying otherwise.</p>",
