        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/{size}/2058_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-17T05:10:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You can also Overwhelm Dodge and Aim and get&nbsp;1 of the corresponding token for each Proletariat you have out, they go away at the start of your turn so may not get to use them all. Great to get 6 Aim when he's got 1 of him surrounded and then Hammer Sweep all targets using Aim for each attack.</p>",
