        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>You can also Overwhelm Dodge and Aim and get&nbsp;1 of the corresponding token for each Proletariat you have out, they go away at the start of your turn so may not get to use them all. Great to get 6 Aim when he&#39;s got 1 of him surrounded and then Hammer Sweep all targets using Aim for each attack.</p>",
